%% State Diagram — Admission Status (ADMISSIONS.admission_status)
%% Updated: 2026-05-18 (English labels)
%% ADMISSION_STATUS lookup: 1=Active, 2=Discharged, 3=Transferred

stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Active : Doctor creates ADMISSION

    Active : 1 — Active treatment
    Discharged : 2 — Discharged
    Transferred : 3 — Transferred

    Active --> Discharged : Patient discharged
    Active --> Transferred : Transfer department/room

    Discharged --> [*]
    Transferred --> [*] : New ADMISSION created
